our email</strong> — a payment receipt\n                  from Stripe will arrive shortly.\n                </span>\n              </li>\n              <li className=\"flex gap-3\">\n                <span className=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold\">\n                  2\n                </span>\n                <span>\n                  <strong className=\"text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200\">WhatsApp confirmation</strong> — we&apos;ll\n                  send your booking details via WhatsApp within 30 minutes.\n                </span>\n              </li>\n              <li className=\"flex gap-3\">\n                <span className=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold\">\n                  3\n                </span>\n                <span>\n                  <strong className=\"text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200\">Check in from 2:00 PM</strong> — bring your\n                  IC/passport. Remaining balance payable at reception.\n                </span>\n              </li>\n            </ol>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* CTA links */}\n          <div className=\"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3\">\n            <Link\n              href=\"/check-in\"\n              className=\"flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-700 text-white\n                         py-3 px-6 font-medium hover:bg-amber-800 transition-colors text-sm\"\n            >\n              Check-in Info\n            </Link>\n            <a\n              href=\"https://wa.me/60127088789?text=Hi%20Pelangi!%20I%20just%20paid%20my%20booking%20deposit%20online.%20Can%20you%20confirm%20my%20reservation?\"\n              target=\"_blank\"\n              rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n              className=\"flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-green-500 text-white\n                         py-3 px-6 font-medium hover:bg-green-600 transition-colors text-sm\"\n            >\n              <svg className=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z\" />\n              </svg>\n              WhatsApp Us\n            </a>\n          </div>\n\n          <p className=\"text-center text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 mt-6\">\n            <Link href=\"/book\" className=\"hover:underline\">Back to booking page</Link>\n            {\" · \"}\n            <Link href=\"/\" className=\"hover:underline\">Home</Link>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <Footer />\n    </main>\n  );\n}\n","numLines":94,"startLine":1,"totalLines":94}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01WCs4PVCUpCRXL1B4PGUKse","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture. The implementation plan:\n\n**Current state:**\n- `globals.css` already has `@media print` styles covering nav, footer, cookie banner, chat widget, sticky booking bar\n- The CTA section (`{/* CTA links */}`) at line 59-80 of confirmation/page.tsx is NOT hidden in print mode\n\n**Missing piece:**\n- Need to add `print:hidden` to the CTA div (line 60) and the \"Back to booking page / Home\" footer links (line 82)\n\n\n---\n\nSo I need to edit the confirmation page to add `print:hidden` to those two sections, then stage just that file for commit. I should check what's actually in the working tree for prd.json since it already has `passes: True` committed, so I might not need to touch it at all.\n\nLooking at the git status, prd.json shows as modified in the working tree but the diff against HEAD is empty—that's a line ending issue I should avoid staging. The SPIRAL diff guard will measure whatever I stage when I commit, so if I only stage the confirmation page changes, the diff should stay small. I'll also update progress.txt for documentation, but the main focus is keeping the staged changes minimal.\n\nThe `@media print` CSS block was already added to globals.css in a previous iteration, covering navigation, footer, cookie banner, chat widget, and sticky booking bar. However, the CTAs on the booking confirmation page—specifically the WhatsApp button and Check-in Info button—aren't hidden in print mode yet. I need to add `print:hidden` to those elements and the footer links paragraph, then commit just those two files without touching prd.json.\n\nI'm realizing the SPIRAL system pre-stashes prd.json before running, so even though the previous commit already set `passes: true`, I need to understand whether this iteration requires updating it again or if the system will detect the CSS changes as sufficient to mark the story as passing.\n\nMy approach is to make a minimal, clean commit with just the confirmation page CSS change (adding `print:hidden` to the CTAs) and update progress.txt, while being careful about whether prd.json actually needs modification or if the line-ending differences are just artifacts from the pre-stash cycle. I'll just execute the plan—make the minimal changes to progress.txt, commit with a small diff, and let the orchestrator determine what happens next based on the current state.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3577,"cache_read_input_tokens":43586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3577},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c20c525-f94e-437f-8820-d67d1831d206","uuid":"3cbaea38-a1ec-4d01-878d-03f34298f439"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01WCs4PVCUpCRXL1B4PGUKse","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Current State\nThe `@media print` CSS block exists in `globals.css` (committed). It hides nav, footer, cookie banner, chat widget, and sticky booking bar. However, the CTA buttons on the booking confirmation page (`book/confirmation/page.tsx`) are NOT hidden in print mode — they lack `print:hidden` Tailwind class.\n\n## Problem Identified\nAcceptance criterion: \"@media print CSS hides navigation, footer, cookie banner, chat widget, sticky booking bar, **and all CTAs**\". The CTA div (lines 59-80) and footer links (line 82) in the confirmation page are missing `print:hidden`.\n\n## Planned Changes\n1. `site/src/app/book/confirmation/page.tsx`: Add `print:hidden` to CTA div (line 60) and footer links paragraph (line 82)\n2. `progress.txt`: Document US-178 completion\n\n<plan>\n{\n  \"files_to_create\": [],\n  \"files_to_modify\": [\"site/src/app/book/confirmation/page.tsx\", \"progress.txt\"],\n  \"functions_to_add\": [],\n  \"estimated_loc\": 8\n}\n</plan>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3577,"cache_read_input_tokens":43586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3577},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c20c525-f94e-437f-8820-d67d1831d206","uuid":"58656a34-5fc0-4418-96c5-11613286b550"}
